  - mathematical physics
  - foundations of physics
abstract: >-
  World Realizability & Epistemic Horizons (WREH) is an interdisciplinary
  research programme and community studying how physically admissible
  observations constrain classes of possible global realizations. The
  programme develops response-defined world spaces, global realizability,
  refinement, non-identifiability, and epistemic horizons while maintaining
  explicit mathematical and physical claim boundaries.
